* CPYOBJ mode 1 (dst 1, src 2): remesh settings of object 2 (MGSIZR..MGWCUV, MGUSER, MGNELM 3D ints, MGSIZM, MGERR, MGGRID, MGTELM, RMDPTH/RMSTRK/RMSTEP/RMTIME) into object 1; first set object 2 values that differ
KFREAD 0
UPSET_Brick.KEY
RMDPTH 2 -0.5
MGNELM 2 3000 1500 0 0
CPYOBJ 1 1 2
KFWRIT
OUT.KEY
